  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>h</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br >    <math><mi>h</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br >    <math><mi>h</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br >    <math><mi>h</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br > <math><mi>h</mi><mi>&prime;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  has at least one root is  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <br >And  <math><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  has at least one in  <math><mo>(</mo><mn>0,2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <br >Hence  <math><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  atleast one root in  <math><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>  but<br >Also,  <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mi> </mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi> </mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <br >    <math><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi> </mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi> </mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi></math> <br > <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  has exactly one solution in (-1, 0) and (0, 2)"
